:"zh"},"510":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk-18","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk#支持的传输","content":"默认端点","locale":"zh"},"511":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk-19","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk#支持的传输","content":"HTTP（POST JSON）","locale":"zh"},"512":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk-20","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk#支持的传输","content":"`SnowLumaHttpClient`","locale":"zh"},"513":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk-21","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk#支持的传输","content":"`http://127.0.0.1:3000/`","locale":"zh"},"514":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk-22","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk#支持的传输","content":"WebSocket（正向 / 反向，含事件）","locale":"zh"},"515":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk-23","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk#支持的传输","content":"`SnowLumaWebSocketClient`","locale":"zh"},"516":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk-24","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk#支持的传输","content":"`ws://127.0.0.1:3001/`","locale":"zh"},"517":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk-25","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk#支持的传输","content":"两个客户端都继承自抽象基类 `SnowLumaApiClient`，因此 `call()` / `request()` 以及所有 camelCase action 快捷方法在两种传输上一致。HTTP 适合纯请求-响应的脚本；WebSocket 在此之上还能 **实时接收事件**。","locale":"zh"},"518":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk-26","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk#http","content":"`SnowLumaHttpClientOptions`：","locale":"zh"},"519":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk-27","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk#http","content":"`baseUrl?` —— OneBot HTTP 端点，默认 `http://127.0.0.1:3000/`。","locale":"zh"},"520":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk-28","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk#http","content":"`accessToken?` —— OneBot 配置里的 token；存在时自动加 `Authorization: Bearer <token>`。","locale":"zh"},"521":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk-29","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk#http","content":"`requestTimeoutMs?` —— 默认超时（毫秒），默认 `30000`。","locale":"zh"},"522":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk-30","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk#http","content":"`fetch?` —— 自定义 `fetch` 实现（测试或非标准运行时用）。","locale":"zh"},"523":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk-31","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk#http","content":"`headers?` —— 每次请求附带的额外请求头。","locale":"zh"},"524":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk-32","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk#websocket","content":"`SnowLumaWebSocketClientOptions`：","locale":"zh"},"525":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk-33","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk#websocket","content":"`url?` —— OneBot WebSocket 端点，默认 `ws://127.0.0.1:3001/`。","locale":"zh"},"526":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk-34","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk#websocket","content":"`accessToken?` —— 通过查询参数附加到连接 URL。","locale":"zh"},"527":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk-35","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk#websocket","content":"`requestTimeoutMs?` —— 默认请求超时，默认 `30000`。","locale":"zh"},"528":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk-36","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk#websocket","content":"`role?` —— 客户端声明的角色：`'Api'` | `'Event'` | `'Universal'`（默认 `'Universal'`）。","locale":"zh"},"529":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk-37","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk#websocket","content":"`reconnect?` —— `true` 或一个 `ReconnectOptions`（`retries` / `minDelayMs` / `maxDelayMs`），开启意外断开后的自动重连。","locale":"zh"},"530":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk-38","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk#websocket","content":"`protocols?` / `webSocket?` —— 可选子协议、可选自定义 `WebSocket` 构造器（Node 运行时或测试用）。","locale":"zh"},"531":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk-39","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk#websocket","content":"浏览器和 Node 24 都自带全局 `WebSocket`，可直接用。若想用 `ws` 包等实现，把它传给 `webSocket` 选项即可。","locale":"zh"},"532":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk-40","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk#websocket","content":"> 两个工厂函数 `createHttpClient(options?)` 和 `createWebSocketClient(options?)` 与 `new` 等价，按个人偏好选用。","locale":"zh"},"533":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk-41","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk#调用一个-action","content":"高频接口提供类型完备的 camelCase 方法（`getLoginInfo`、`sendGroupMessage`、`setGroupBan`……）。任意已注册的 action 都能用 `raw` / `rawResponse` 调用。","locale":"zh"},"534":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk-42","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk#调用一个-action","content":"底层方法：","locale":"zh"},"535":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk-43","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk#调用一个-action","content":"`call(action, params?, options?)` —— 发送 action，返回 `data`；当 `status` 为 `failed` 或 `retcode !== 0` 时抛 `SnowLumaApiError`。","locale":"zh"},"536":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk-44","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk#调用一个-action","content":"`request(action, params?, options?)` —— 返回完整响应信封，不抛业务错。","locale":"zh"},"537":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk-45","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk#调用一个-action","content":"每次请求都可通过 `RequestOptions` 覆盖行为：`echo`（关联值）、`timeoutMs`（`0` 表示禁用超时）、`signal`（`AbortSignal`）。","locale":"zh"},"538":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk-46","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk#订阅事件","content":"事件订阅是 WebSocket 客户端独有的能力。客户端用 `echo` 关联 API 响应，把没有 `echo` 的包当作事件分发。","locale":"zh"},"539":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk-47","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk#订阅事件","content":"可用的事件助手：`onMessage` / `onPrivateMessage` / `onGroupMessage` / `onNotice(type?)` / `onRequest(type?)` / `onMetaEvent` / `command()`，以及更底层的 `onEvent`、`when(predicate, handler)`、`use(middleware)`。生命周期事件用 `on('open' | 'close' | 'error' | 'response' | 'raw', …)`；每个 `on` / `when` / `use` 都返回一个取消订阅的函数。","locale":"zh"},"540":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk-48","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk#订阅事件","content":"事件上下文（`ctx`）内置快捷操作：","locale":"zh"},"541":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk-49","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk#订阅事件","content":"`ctx.reply(message)` —— 按私聊 / 群聊自动回复。","locale":"zh"},"542":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk-50","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk#订阅事件","content":"`ctx.approve()` / `ctx.reject(reason)` —— 处理好友或群请求。","locale":"zh"},"543":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk-51","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk#订阅事件","content":"`ctx.quickOperation(operation)` —— 调用 `.handle_quick_operation`。","locale":"zh"},"544":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk-52","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk#订阅事件","content":"`ctx.stopPropagation()` —— 停止后续中间件分发。","locale":"zh"},"545":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk-53","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk#消息构造器","content":"SDK 自带链式消息构造器和段工厂，发送接口直接接受它的产物：","locale":"zh"},"546":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk-54","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk#消息构造器","content":"内置段：`text`、`br`、`face`、`at`、`atAll`、`reply`、`image`、`record`、`video`、`json`、`xml`、`poke`、`forward`、`node`、`share`、`music`、`location`、`contact`、`raw`。`reply()` 在一条链里只能出现一次。","locale":"zh"},"547":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk-55","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk#自动重连ack-关联与共享类型","content":"**ack 关联** —— WebSocket 客户端给每个请求生成 `echo`，把响应路由回对应的 `Promise`，因此并发请求不会串台。可通过 `RequestOptions.echo` 覆盖关联值。","locale":"zh"},"548":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk-56","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk#自动重连ack-关联与共享类型","content":"**自动重连** —— `reconnect: true`（或 `ReconnectOptions`）启用指数退避（`minDelayMs` 默认 1000，`maxDelayMs` 默认 30000）。断线时所有挂起请求会以 `SnowLumaConnectionError` 拒绝。","locale":"zh"},"549":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk-57","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk#自动重连ack-关联与共享类型","content":"**共享 action 类型** —— action 名、参数和结果类型与 `@snowluma/core` 同源，因此调用面始终与服务端一致。","locale":"zh"},"550":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk-58","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk#自动重连ack-关联与共享类型","content":"**统一错误体系** —— 所有错误继承 `SnowLumaError`：业务失败抛 `SnowLumaApiError`（鉴权类 retcode 走 `SnowLumaAuthError`），传输层抛 `SnowLumaTransportError` 基类下的 `SnowLumaConnectionError` / `SnowLumaParseError` / `SnowLumaTimeoutError` / `SnowLumaAbortError`。","locale":"zh"},"551":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk-59","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk#子路径导入","content":"除了主入口，包还提供分模块导出：`@snowluma/sdk/client`、`/messages`、`/events`、`/types`、`/errors`、`/actions`。按需精确导入即可。","locale":"zh"},"552":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk-60","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk#相关链接","content":"配置 —— 启用并保护 OneBot HTTP / WS 网络适配器，拿到 `accessToken`。","locale":"zh"},"553":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk-61","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk#相关链接","content":"开发者文档 —— monorepo 结构与运行时内部。","locale":"zh"},"554":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk-62","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk#相关链接","content":"MCP 服务 —— 给 LLM 用的另一套接入方式。","locale":"zh"},"555":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/baota","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/baota","type":"page","content":"宝塔面板部署","breadcrumbs":["Docs","部署"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/baota","locale":"zh"},"556":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/baota-0","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/baota","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/baota","content":"在已安装宝塔面板的 Linux 服务器上通过 Docker 应用商店一键部署 SnowLuma","locale":"zh"},"557":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/baota-1","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/baota","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/baota#导入并安装","content":"导入并安装","locale":"zh"},"558":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/baota-2","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/baota","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/baota#首次登录","content":"首次登录","locale":"zh"},"559":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/baota-3","pa