docs/guide/deploy/docker#远程桌面密码","content":"官方镜像**没有**公开的固定密码，也不要去抄网上或旧文档里的示例值。","locale":"zh"},"628":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/docker-46","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/docker#远程桌面密码","content":"**不设 `VNC_PASSWD`**：第一次启动会生成随机密码，**只在容器日志里打印一次**（中英各一行）。之后保存在数据卷里；重建容器或升级镜像，只要卷还在，密码不变，日志也不会再打。","locale":"zh"},"629":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/docker-47","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/docker#远程桌面密码","content":"**想用自己的密码**：启动时设置 `VNC_PASSWD`。只有你主动改这个值时才会换密码，并再打印一次。","locale":"zh"},"630":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/docker-48","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/docker#远程桌面密码","content":"环境变量里如果还写着旧文档的公开默认值，下次启动会当成「未设置」，换成新的随机密码。","locale":"zh"},"631":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/docker-49","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/docker#远程桌面密码","content":"`6081` 也不要裸放到公网。","locale":"zh"},"632":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/docker-50","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/docker#远程桌面密码","content":"查看当前密码（只在生成或你主动更换时会出现）：","locale":"zh"},"633":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/docker-51","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/docker#远程桌面密码","content":"重启后日志里找不到是正常的，用第一次记下的那串即可。","locale":"zh"},"634":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/docker-52","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/docker#ptrace-权限","content":"`--cap-add=SYS_PTRACE` 和 `--security-opt seccomp=unconfined` 仍然不能省。","locale":"zh"},"635":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/docker-53","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/docker#ptrace-权限","content":"SnowLuma 的 native addon 通过 `ptrace` 把 hook 注入到容器内的 QQ 进程。官方镜像会给 `/usr/local/bin/node` 设置 `cap_sys_ptrace`，所以 SnowLuma 即使用 `snowluma` 普通用户运行，也能在容器的 capability 边界内完成注入。","locale":"zh"},"636":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/docker-54","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/docker#ptrace-权限","content":"因此，新版官方镜像**不需要**再修改宿主机的 `kernel.yama.ptrace_scope`。只要启动容器时保留：","locale":"zh"},"637":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/docker-55","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/docker#ptrace-权限","content":"如果你想确认镜像内的 file capability 是否存在：","locale":"zh"},"638":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/docker-56","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/docker#ptrace-权限","content":"如果旧镜像仍要求你修改宿主机 sysctl，优先升级镜像；只有在无法升级的临时排障场景下，才考虑调整宿主机 `kernel.yama.ptrace_scope`。","locale":"zh"},"639":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/docker-57","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/docker#一行-docker-run","content":"`--cap-add=SYS_PTRACE` 和 `--security-opt seccomp=unconfined` **不能省**。SnowLuma 的 native addon 通过 ptrace 把 hook 注入 QQ 进程，默认 seccomp profile 会拦截。","locale":"zh"},"640":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/docker-58","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/docker#一行-docker-run","content":"`--shm-size=1g` 是 QQ（基于 Chromium）的运行要求，容器默认 `/dev/shm` 太小会崩。","locale":"zh"},"641":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/docker-59","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/docker#docker-compose","content":"更推荐用 Compose。仓库 `docker-compose.yml`：","locale":"zh"},"642":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/docker-60","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/docker#docker-compose","content":"启动：","locale":"zh"},"643":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/docker-61","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/docker#docker-compose","content":"升级镜像：","locale":"zh"},"644":{"id":"