guide/deploy/linux-manual","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual#1-安装-node-24-lts","content":"1\\. 安装 Node 24 LTS","locale":"zh"},"831":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual-3","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual#2-安装-linux-qq-及依赖","content":"2\\. 安装 Linux QQ 及依赖","locale":"zh"},"832":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual-4","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual#3-起无头-x-桌面--vnc--novnc","content":"3\\. 起无头 X 桌面 + VNC / noVNC","locale":"zh"},"833":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual-5","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual#4-给-node-授予-ptrace不用-root","content":"4\\. 给 node 授予 ptrace（不用 root）","locale":"zh"},"834":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual-6","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual#5-冻结-qq-热更新","content":"5\\. 冻结 QQ 热更新","locale":"zh"},"835":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual-7","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual#6-下载并运行-snowlumalite","content":"6\\. 下载并运行 SnowLuma（lite）","locale":"zh"},"836":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual-8","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual#7-拉起-qq扫码打开-webui","content":"7\\. 拉起 QQ、扫码、打开 WebUI","locale":"zh"},"837":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual-9","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual#环境依赖说明请实话实说地对待","content":"环境依赖说明（请实话实说地对待）","locale":"zh"},"838":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual-10","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual#8-会话保活","content":"8\\. 会话保活","locale":"zh"},"839":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual-11","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual#相关链接","content":"相关链接","locale":"zh"},"840":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual-12","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual","content":"在 Linux 上**官方推荐、也只正式支持 Docker**：Docker 部署 把 Linux QQ + Xvfb + VNC + noVNC + supervisord + ptrace 权限 + 热更新冻结全部封装好了，开箱即用。本页是**手动复刻镜像内部所做的事**，面向**无法 / 不愿用 Docker** 的进阶用户。步骤多、坑多、且强依赖你的发行版与内核配置——如果你只是想跑起来，请回到 Docker 部署。","locale":"zh"},"841":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual-13","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual","content":"本页对应官方镜像 `start.sh` 的手动版：装 Node、装 Linux QQ、起一套无头 X 桌面、给 node 授予 ptrace、冻结 QQ 热更新、跑 SnowLuma、扫码登录。下文命令以 &#x2A;*Ubuntu 24.04 (Noble)** 为例，其它发行版包名 / 路径会有出入，请自行换算。","locale":"zh"},"842":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual-14","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual#总览","content":"手动部署等价于把镜像里这几件事按顺序做一遍：","locale":"zh"},"843":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual-15","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual#总览","content":"安装 Node 24 LTS（lite 发行包不带 Node 运行时）。","locale":"zh"},"844":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual-16","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual#总览","content":"安装 Linux QQ（官方 `.deb`）及其 Electron / CJK 依赖。","locale":"zh"},"845":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual-17","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual#总览","content":"起一套无头 X 桌面（Xvfb + fluxbox）+ VNC / noVNC，方便扫码。","locale":"zh"},"846":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual-18","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual#总览","content":"在**不使用 root** 的前提下给 node 授予 `cap_sys_ptrace`（hook 靠 ptrace 注入）。","locale":"zh"},"847":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual-19","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual#总览","content":"冻结 QQ 静默热更新（black-hole 补丁域名），保住版本对齐的 native hook。","locale":"zh"},"848":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual-20","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual#总览","content":"下载并解包 SnowLuma `-lite` linux tarball，`node ./index.mjs` 运行。","locale":"zh"},"849":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual-21","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual#总览","content":"用文档化的启动参数拉起 QQ，noVNC 扫码登录，打开 WebUI。","locale":"zh"},"850":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual-22","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual#1-安装-node-24-lts","content":"SnowLuma 需要 **Node.js ≥ 22**。2026 年 **Node 24（\"Krypton\"）是 Active LTS**，22（\"Jod\"）已进入 Maintenance LTS，新装建议直接 24。lite 发行包不带运行时，所以这一步必须做。","locale":"zh"},"851":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual-23","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual#1-安装-node-24-lts","content":"Debian/Ubuntu 任选一种：","locale":"zh"},"852":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual-24","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual#1-安装-node-24-lts","content":"Node 版本见 Node 发布说明。用 nvm 时，后面的 `setcap` 必须打在 **nvm 解出来的真实 node 二进制**上，每次 `nvm install` / `nvm use` 换版本都要重做。","locale":"zh"},"853":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual-25","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual#1-安装-node-24-lts","content":"如果你下的是 **full** tarball（自带 Node 运行时），可以跳过这一步——但 full 包体积大很多，本页全程基于更常用的 **lite** 流程。","locale":"zh"},"854":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual-26","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual#2-安装-linux-qq-及依赖","content":"官方 Linux QQ 下载页是 JS 渲染的，**不要硬编码版本号**，去 https\\://im.qq.com/linuxqq/download.html 抓你架构对应的当前 `.deb`：","locale":"zh"},"855":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual-27","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual#2-安装-linux-qq-及依赖","content":"QQ 装到 `/opt/QQ/`，启动器 `/opt/QQ/qq`。","locale":"zh"},"856":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual-28","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual#2-安装-linux-qq-及依赖","content":"补齐 Electron / CJK 运行依赖。&#x2A;*Ubuntu 24.04 注意是 `libasound2t64`，不是 `libasound2`**：","locale":"zh"},"857":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual-29","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual#2-安装-linux-qq-及依赖","content":"`fonts-noto-cjk` 不装的话 QQ 界面里中文会变方块。","locale":"zh"},"858":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual-30","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual#3-起无头-x-桌面--vnc--novnc","content":"登录是**纯扫码**，没有 CLI 登录，所以你必须能\"看到\"QQ 窗口去扫码。无头服务器上用 Xvfb 造一个虚拟屏幕，fluxbox 让 QQ 的登录对话框能正常映射，再用 x11vnc + noVNC 把这块屏幕投到浏览器。","locale":"zh"},"859":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual-31","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual#3-起无头-x-桌面--vnc--novnc","content":"安装（Ubuntu 24.04 包名）：","locale":"zh"},"860":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual-32","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual#3-起无头-x-桌面--vnc--novnc","content":"起虚拟屏幕并设 `DISPLAY`（镜像用 `:1`）：","locale":"zh"},"861":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual-33","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual#3-起无头-x-桌面--vnc--novnc","content":"起窗口管理器（否则登录对话框可能无边框 / 无法聚焦）：","locale":"zh"},"862":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual-34","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual#3-起无头-x-桌面--vnc--novnc","content":"起 VNC（**务必设密码**，下面会落到 `~/.vnc/passwd`）：","locale":"zh"},"863":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual-35","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual#3-起无头-x-桌面--vnc--novnc","content":"起 noVNC（浏览器版 VNC，免客户端）。Ubuntu 的 noVNC 启动器在 `/usr/share/novnc/utils/novnc_proxy`：","locale":"zh"},"864":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual-36","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual#3-起无头-x-桌面--vnc--novnc","content":"然后浏览器打开 `http://<你的IP>:6081/vnc.html`，用刚设的 VNC 密码连上，就能看到那块 `:1` 虚拟桌面。","locale":"zh"},"865":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual-37","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual#3-起无头-x-桌面--vnc--novnc","content":"**别把 VNC（5900）/ noVNC（6081）/ WebUI（5099）/ OneBot（3000、3001）裸暴露到公网。** 用防火墙锁到本机、走 SSH 隧道或反代加鉴权。VNC 一定要设强密码——否则你的 QQ 桌面在公网上裸奔。","locale":"zh"},"866":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual-38","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual#4-给-node-授予-ptrace不用-root","content":"SnowLuma 的 native addon 通过 `ptrace` 把 hook 注入 QQ 进程。与其用 root 跑，不如给 node 二进制一个文件 capability：","locale":"zh"},"867":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual-39","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual#4-给-node-授予-ptrace不用-root","content":"验证：","locale":"zh"},"868":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual-40","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual#4-给-node-授予-ptrace不用-root","content":"setcap 的几个坑（务必读）：","locale":"zh"},"869":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual-41","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual#4-给-node-授予-ptrace不用-root","content":"**必须作用在真实二进制上**——`readlink -f` 解开 `which node` 的软链，capability 不会跟着软链走。","locale":"zh"},"870":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual-42","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual#4-给-node-授予-ptrace不用-root","content":"**node 升级 / 拷贝后会丢**，每次升级 Node 都要重新 `setcap`。","locale":"zh"},"871":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual-43","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual#4-给-node-授予-ptrace不用-root","content":"**需要支持 xattr 的文件系统**，某些 overlay / tmpfs 上 `setcap` 会失败。","locale":"zh"},"872":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual-44","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual#4-给-node-授予-ptrace不用-root","content":"受内核 &#x2A;*Yama `ptrace_scope`** 约束：`0` / `1` / `2` 都能配合 file capability 工作，但 `3` 会彻底禁用 ptrace。查看：`cat /proc/sys/kernel/yama/ptrace_scope`。","locale":"zh"},"873":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual-45","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual#5-冻结-qq-热更新","content":"QQ 有一条**静默热更新**通道，会在后台悄悄改字节，把你版本对齐的 native hook 打坏。（界面里\"立即更新\"那种整包更新对话框是点击触发的，无头环境永远不会自己弹，所以只需要堵静默通道。）做法是把补丁域名 black-hole 掉：","locale":"zh"},"874":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual-46","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual#5-冻结-qq-热更新","content":"这样 QQ 拉不到静默补丁，版本保持稳定，hook 不会被悄悄换掉。","locale":"zh"},"875":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual-47","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual#6-下载并运行-snowlumalite","content":"从 GitHub Release 下你架构对应的 &#x2A;*`-lite`** linux tarball：https\\://github.com/SnowLuma/SnowLuma/releases","locale":"zh"},"876":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual-48","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual#6-下载并运行-snowlumalite","content":"首次启动会在数据目录自建配置（`config/onebot.json`、`config/runtime.json` 等），并在**日志里打印一次性 WebUI 管理员密码**——记下来，它只在全新数据目录首启时出现一次。","locale":"zh"},"877":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual-49","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual#6-下载并运行-snowlumalite","content":"默认服务：OneBot HTTP `0.0.0.0:3000`、OneBot WS `0.0.0.0:3001`、WebUI `0.0.0.0:5099`。配置细节见 配置说明。环境变量优先级高于 `runtime.json`。","locale":"zh"},"878":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual-50","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual#7-拉起-qq扫码打开-webui","content":"让 SnowLuma 在前台或另一个会话里跑着，然后在&#x2A;*同一个 `DISPLAY=:1`** 下用文档化的启动参数拉起 QQ：","locale":"zh"},"879":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual-51","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual#7-拉起-qq扫码打开-webui","content":"接着：","locale":"zh"},"880":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual-52","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual#7-拉起-qq扫码打开-webui","content":"浏览器打开 `http://<你的IP>:6081/vnc.html`，连上 VNC，能看到 QQ 的二维码。","locale":"zh"},"881":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual-53","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual#7-拉起-qq扫码打开-webui","content":"手机 QQ 扫码登录。","locale":"zh"},"882":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual-54","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual#7-拉起-qq扫码打开-webui","content":"登录完成后，hook 默认自动从被动观察切到工作模式（`runtime.json.hookAutoLoad` 默认开；设 `false` 或 `SNOWLUMA_HOOK_AUTOLOAD=0` 可改回 WebUI 手动 Load）。","locale":"zh"},"883":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual-55","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual#7-拉起-qq扫码打开-webui","content":"浏览器打开 `http://<你的IP>:5099/` 进 WebUI，用日志里那串临时密码登录。","locale":"zh"},"884":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual-56","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual#7-拉起-qq扫码打开-webui","content":"多账号无需额外配置：SnowLuma 会遍历所有 QQ 主进程逐个注入，每个 UIN 自动起一个 OneBot 实例、各自存 `config/onebot_<uin>.json`。多开的关键同样是&#x2A;*给每个 QQ 实例独立的 `HOME`**（QQ 自带单实例锁）。","locale":"zh"},"885":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual-57","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual#环境依赖说明请实话实说地对待","content":"手动流程对环境很敏感，以下几点高度取决于你的机器：","locale":"zh"},"886":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual-58","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual#环境依赖说明请实话实说地对待","content":"**包名 / 路径**因发行版而异（上文按 Ubuntu 24.04）。Debian、Arch、RHEL 系的 `libasound`、X 工具、noVNC 启动器路径都不一样。","locale":"zh"},"887":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual-59","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual#环境依赖说明请实话实说地对待","content":"**setcap** 在某些容器化 / overlay / tmpfs 文件系统上会失败（见第 4 节）。","locale":"zh"},"888":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual-60","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual#环境依赖说明请实话实说地对待","content":"**Yama `ptrace_scope=3`** 会让 ptrace 注入彻底失效。","locale":"zh"},"889":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual-61","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual#环境依赖说明请实话实说地对待","content":"如果其中任何一步在你的环境里卡住，**最省心的办法仍然是回到 Docker 部署**——镜像已经把这些坑全趟平了。","locale":"zh"},"890":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual-62","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual#8-会话保活","content":"SSH 一断，上面用 `&` 拉起的 Xvfb / VNC / QQ / SnowLuma 都会收到 `SIGHUP` 跟着死。登录态在 QQ 的 `HOME` 里，**进程没了二维码界面也没了**，下次还得重新拉起整套。长期跑必须有人托管这些进程。","locale":"zh"},"891":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual-63","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual#8-会话保活","content":"先用 **tmux** 把流程跑通；确认扫码、WebUI、发消息都稳定之后，再换成 **systemd**。Docker 路径没有这个问题：`--restart unless-stopped` 已经在管。","locale":"zh"},"892":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual-64","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual#8-会话保活","content":"这些进程必须共享同一个 `DISPLAY=:1`，顺序不能反：先 Xvfb，再窗口管理器，再 VNC / noVNC，再 QQ，最后 SnowLuma。","locale":"zh"},"893":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual-65","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual#8-会话保活","content":"`loginctl enable-linger` 让用户 systemd 在 SSH 登出后继续跑。日志：`journalctl --user -u snowluma-stack -f`。改脚本后 `systemctl --user restart snowluma-stack`。","locale":"zh"},"894":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual-66","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual#8-会话保活","content":"官方 host 模式安装器会拆成 Xvfb / fluxbox / VNC / noVNC / QQ / SnowLuma 六个 unit，挂在 `snowluma.target` 下。手搓先用这一条 wrapper 就够；要拆分再抄 `templates/host`。","locale":"zh"},"895":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual-67","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual#8-会话保活","content":"不要用 `nohup … &` 当长期方案：没重启策略，也没有统一日志。","locale":"zh"},"896":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual-68","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual#8-会话保活","content":"systemd user unit 的 `HOME` 必须和 QQ 扫码时同一个，否则登录态对不上。","locale":"zh"},"897":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual-69","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual#8-会话保活","content":"`novnc_proxy` 路径因发行版而异；Debian/Ubuntu 常见 `/usr/share/novnc/utils/novnc_proxy`。","locale":"zh"},"898":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual-70","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual#8-会话保活","content":"升级 Node 后记得重新 `setcap`，否则重启服务注入会失败。","locale":"zh"},"899":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual-71","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual#相关链接","content":"部署方式选择 — 各平台部署对比","locale":"zh"},"900":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual-72","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual#相关链接","content":"Docker 部署 — Linux 上的推荐方式","locale":"zh"},"901":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual-73","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual#相关链接","content":"一键安装（实验性） — Alpha 脚本，含 host 模式 unit","locale":"zh"},"902":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual-74","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual#相关链接","content":"手机部署 — Android 上跑本页的手动流程","locale":"zh"},"903":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual-75","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual#相关链接","content":"更新升级","locale":"zh"},"904":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual-76","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/linux-manual#相关链接","content":"配置说明","locale":"zh"},"905":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/mobile","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/mobile","type":"page","content":"手机部署（Android，实验性）","breadcrumbs":["Docs","部署"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/mobile","locale":"zh"},"906":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/mobile-0","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/mobile","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/mobile","content":"在 Android 上通过 Termux + proot Ubuntu 手动跑 SnowLuma","locale":"zh"},"907":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/mobile-1","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/mobile","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/mobile#现实情况docker-在手机上基本跑不动","content":"现实情况：Docker 在手机上基本跑不动","locale":"zh"},"908":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/mobile-2","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/mobile","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/mobile#第一步装-termux","content":"第一步：装 Termux","locale":"zh"},"909":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/mobile-3","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/mobile","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/mobile#第二步装-proot-ubuntu","content":"第二步：装 proot Ubuntu","locale":"zh"},"910":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/mobile-4","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/mobile","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/mobile#第三步在-proot-ubuntu-里跑-linux-手动流程","content":"第三步：在 proot Ubuntu 里跑 Linux 手动流程","locale":"zh"},"911":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/mobile-5","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/mobile","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/mobile#诚实的限制说明","content":"诚实的限制说明","locale":"zh"},"912":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/mobile-6","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/mobile","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/mobile#关于手机上的-docker","content":"关于\"手机上的 Docker\"","locale":"zh"},"913":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/mobile-7","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/mobile","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/mobile#相关链接","content":"相关链接","locale":"zh"},"914":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/mobile-8","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/mobile","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/mobile","content":"手机部署是**实验性、进阶**用法，资源消耗大，并不适合大多数人。如果你有一台 PC / 服务器，请优先用 Docker 部署。本页只是说明在 Android 上\"能跑\"的现实路径，并诚实地交代它的限制。","locale":"zh"},"915":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/mobile-9","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/mobile","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/mobile#现实情况docker-在手机上基本跑不动","content":"先把期望摆正：","locale":"zh"},"916":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/mobile-10","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/mobile","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/mobile#现实情况docker-在手机上基本跑不动","content":"**无 root 的 Linux 用户态在 Android 上很容易**——用 Termux + `proot-distro` 装一个 Ubuntu 即可。","locale":"zh"},"917":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/mobile-11","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/mobile","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/mobile#现实情况docker-在手机上基本跑不动","content":"**但真正的 Docker（dockerd）在 proot 下跑不起来。** proot 只是一个基于 ptrace 的系统调用模拟器，没有 namespaces / cgroups / netfilter，而这些正是容器运行时所依赖的。","locale":"zh"},"918":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/mobile-12","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/mobile","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/mobile#现实情况docker-在手机上基本跑不动","content":"想在手机上跑**真 Docker**只能上虚拟机（Termux 里的 QEMU，或 Podroid 这类 App）。但手机一般没有 KVM，只能走 TCG 软件模拟，**非常慢**，对绝大多数用户不实用。Google AVF 的\"Linux 终端\"是真 VM，但其官方镜像在 2026 年仍不是开箱即用的容器环境。","locale":"zh"},"919":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/mobile-13","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/mobile","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/mobile#现实情况docker-在手机上基本跑不动","content":"**因此手机上的现实推荐：Termux + proot Ubuntu，然后在里面按 Linux 手动部署 流程手动跑 SnowLuma。** 手机上的 Docker 留给极客折腾，不在本页推荐范围。","locale":"zh"},"920":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/mobile-14","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/mobile","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/mobile#现实情况docker-在手机上基本跑不动","content":"各平台对比见 部署方式选择。","locale":"zh"},"921":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/mobile-15","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/mobile","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/mobile#第一步装-termux","content":"**别从 Google Play 装 Termux。** Play 商店里的版本早已停更、有已知问题。请从 **F-Droid** 或 Termux 的 GitHub Releases 安装。","locale":"zh"},"922":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/mobile-16","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/mobile","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/mobile#第一步装-termux","content":"F-Droid：https\\://f-droid.org/packages/com.termux/","locale":"zh"},"923":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/mobile-17","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/mobile","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/mobile#第一步装-termux","content":"GitHub：https\\://github.com/termux/termux-app/releases","locale":"zh"},"924":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/mobile-18","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/mobile","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/mobile#第一步装-termux","content":"装好后先更新一下：","locale":"zh"},"925":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/mobile-19","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/mobile","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/mobile#第二步装-proot-ubuntu","content":"进去之后你就在一个 Ubuntu 用户态里了。文档见 https\\://github.com/termux/proot-distro 与 https\\://wiki.termux.com。","locale":"zh"},"926":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/mobile-20","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/mobile","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/mobile#第三步在-proot-ubuntu-里跑-linux-手动流程","content":"剩下的步骤和 Linux 手动部署 **完全一致**，在 proot Ubuntu 里依次做：","locale":"zh"},"927":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/mobile-21","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/mobile","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/mobile#第三步在-proot-ubuntu-里跑-linux-手动流程","content":"安装 Node 24 LTS。","locale":"zh"},"928":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/mobile-22","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/mobile","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/mobile#第三步在-proot-ubuntu-里跑-linux-手动流程","content":"安装 Linux QQ（`.deb`）及 Electron / CJK 依赖（Ubuntu 24.04 注意 `libasound2t64`）。","locale":"zh"},"929":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/mobile-23","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/mobile","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/mobile#第三步在-proot-ubuntu-里跑-linux-手动流程","content":"起 Xvfb + fluxbox + x11vnc + noVNC，用浏览器扫码。","locale":"zh"},"930":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/mobile-24","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/mobile","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/mobile#第三步在-proot-ubuntu-里跑-linux-手动流程","content":"给 node 授予 `cap_sys_ptrace`。","locale":"zh"},"931":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/mobile-25","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/mobile","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/mobile#第三步在-proot-ubuntu-里跑-linux-手动流程","content":"冻结 QQ 热更新（`/etc/hosts` black-hole `qqpatch.gtimg.cn`）。","locale":"zh"},"932":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/mobile-26","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/mobile","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/mobile#第三步在-proot-ubuntu-里跑-linux-手动流程","content":"下载并解包 SnowLuma `-lite` linux tarball，`node ./index.mjs`。","locale":"zh"},"933":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/mobile-27","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/mobile","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/mobile#第三步在-proot-ubuntu-里跑-linux-手动流程","content":"拉起 QQ、扫码、打开 WebUI。","locale":"zh"},"934":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/mobile-28","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/mobile","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/mobile#第三步在-proot-ubuntu-里跑-linux-手动流程","content":"由于一切都在手机本机，noVNC / WebUI 直接用 `http://localhost:6081` / `http://localhost:5099` 在手机浏览器里打开即可。","locale":"zh"},"935":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/mobile-29","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/mobile","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/mobile#第三步在-proot-ubuntu-里跑-linux-手动流程","content":"请直接照搬 Linux 手动部署 的完整命令，本页不再重复。","locale":"zh"},"936":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/mobile-30","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/mobile","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/mobile#诚实的限制说明","content":"**ptrace 注入在 proot 下可能受限。** SnowLuma 的 hook 靠 ptrace 注入 QQ 进程，而 proot 本身就是个 ptrace 模拟层——两者叠加时注入是否成功**高度取决于设备、内核与 proot 版本**，不保证可用。这是本路径最大的不确定点。","locale":"zh"},"937":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/mobile-31","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/mobile","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/mobile#诚实的限制说明","content":"**资源吃紧。** QQ 是基于 Chromium 的 Electron 应用，外加一整套 Xvfb + VNC + Node，对手机内存 / 发热 / 电量压力很大。低端机基本带不动。","locale":"zh"},"938":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/mobile-32","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/mobile","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/mobile#诚实的限制说明","content":"**arm64。** 手机基本都是 arm64，记得 Node、Linux QQ、SnowLuma 都要选 `arm64` 版本。","locale":"zh"},"939":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/mobile-33","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/mobile","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/mobile#诚实的限制说明","content":"**会话保活。** Termux 进程可能被系统省电策略杀掉；用 Termux 的 wake-lock，并考虑关掉该 App 的电池优化。","locale":"zh"},"940":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/mobile-34","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/mobile","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/mobile#诚实的限制说明","content":"**架构选错就跑不起来。** lite tarball 选 `linux-arm64-lite`，QQ `.deb` 选 arm64。","locale":"zh"},"941":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/mobile-35","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/mobile","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/mobile#诚实的限制说明","content":"整体而言：&#x2A;*手机部署可以作为尝鲜 / 应急，但不是稳定生产方案。** 想长期稳定，请用 PC / 服务器上的 Docker 部署。","locale":"zh"},"942":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/mobile-36","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/mobile","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/mobile#关于手机上的-docker","content":"如果你执意要在手机上跑 Docker，唯一可行方向是在 Termux 里用 QEMU 起一个 x86\\_64/arm64 的 Linux 虚拟机、在 VM 里装真 Docker，再按 Docker 部署 操作。但没有 KVM 的纯软件模拟非常慢，**不推荐**，这里仅作说明，不展开。","locale":"zh"},"943":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/mobile-37","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/mobile","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/mobile#相关链接","content":"部署方式选择","locale":"zh"},"944":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/mobile-38","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/mobile","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/mobile#相关链接","content":"Linux 手动部署 — 本页的核心步骤都在这里","locale":"zh"},"945":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/mobile-39","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/mobile","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/mobile#相关链接","content":"Docker 部署 — 真正推荐的方式","locale":"zh"},"946":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/mobile-40","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/mobile","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/mobile#相关链接","content":"配置说明","locale":"zh"},"947":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/storage-migration","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/storage-migration","type":"page","content":"Docker 持久化数据迁移","breadcrumbs":["Docs","部署"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/storage-migration","locale":"zh"},"948":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/storage-migration-0","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/storage-migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/storage-migration","content":"将现有 Docker 数据安全迁移到当前持久化布局","locale":"zh"},"949":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/storage-migration-1","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/storage-migration","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/storage-migration#1-确认旧容器","content":"1\\. 确认旧容器","locale":"zh"},"950":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/storage-migration-2","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/storage-migration","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/storage-migration#2-停止容器","content":"2\\. 停止容器","locale":"zh"},"951":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/storage-migration-3","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/storage-migration","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/storage-migration#3-创建当前数据卷","content":"3\\. 创建当前数据卷","locale":"zh"},"952":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/storage-migration-4","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/storage-migration","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/storage-migration#4-复制并校验数据","content":"4\\. 复制并校验数据","locale":"zh"},"953":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/storage-migration-5","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/storage-migration","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/storage-migration#5-更新-compose-配置","content":"5\\. 更新 Compose 配置","locale":"zh"},"954":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/storage-migration-6","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/storage-migration","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/storage-migration#6-验证迁移结果","content":"6\\. 验证迁移结果","locale":"zh"},"955":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/storage-migration-7","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/storage-migration","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/storage-migration#绑定目录与多账号","content":"绑定目录与多账号","locale":"zh"},"956":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/storage-migration-8","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/storage-migration","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/storage-migration#使用宿主机目录","content":"使用宿主机目录","locale":"zh"},"957":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/storage-migration-9","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/storage-migration","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/storage-migration#多账号","content":"多账号","locale":"zh"},"958":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/storage-migration-10","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/storage-migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/storage-migration","content":"新版本统一了容器内的持久化布局。Docker 不会自动把已有命名卷的数据复制到新的命名卷，因此，从旧版 Docker 配置升级时需要迁移一次。","locale":"zh"},"959":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/storage-migration-11","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/storage-migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/storage-migration","content":"迁移会保留 SnowLuma 配置、OneBot 配置、QQ 登录状态和 QQ 本地数据。整个过程不会删除旧数据卷。","locale":"zh"},"960":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/storage-migration-12","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/storage-migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/storage-migration","content":"保留旧容器，先不要执行 `docker compose down` 或删除容器。","locale":"zh"},"961":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/storage-migration-13","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/storage-migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/storage-migration","content":"不要执行 `docker compose down -v`，它会删除 Compose 管理的数据卷。","locale":"zh"},"962":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/storage-migration-14","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/storage-migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/storage-migration","content":"迁移时需要停止容器，请预留短暂停机时间。","locale":"zh"},"963":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/storage-migration-15","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/storage-migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/storage-migration","content":"宿主机应留有足够空间，迁移期间新旧数据会同时存在。","locale":"zh"},"964":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/storage-migration-16","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/storage-migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/storage-migration#1-确认旧容器","content":"以下命令默认容器名是 `snowluma`。如果你修改过容器名，请替换第一行。","locale":"zh"},"965":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/storage-migration-17","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/storage-migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/storage-migration#1-确认旧容器","content":"输出中应能看到以下三个容器路径：","locale":"zh"},"966":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/storage-migration-18","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/storage-migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/storage-migration#1-确认旧容器","content":"如果缺少任一路径，请停止迁移并检查原部署配置。","locale":"zh"},"967":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/storage-migration-19","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/storage-migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/storage-migration#2-停止容器","content":"停止容器可以避免配置数据库或 QQ 登录数据在复制过程中继续变化。","locale":"zh"},"968":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/storage-migration-20","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/storage-migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/storage-migration#2-停止容器","content":"不要删除这个容器。后续复制会直接读取它当前挂载的数据，因此不需要猜测 Compose 自动生成的卷名。","locale":"zh"},"969":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/storage-migration-21","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/storage-migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/storage-migration#3-创建当前数据卷","content":"确认三个目标卷都是空的：","locale":"zh"},"970":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/storage-migration-22","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/storage-migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/storage-migration#3-创建当前数据卷","content":"如果这里报错，请不要覆盖目标卷。先确认它是否来自之前未完成的迁移。","locale":"zh"},"971":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/storage-migration-23","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/storage-migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/storage-migration#4-复制并校验数据","content":"下面的命令以只读方式挂载旧容器的数据卷，将数据复制到当前数据卷，并逐文件校验内容。首次运行可能需要下载体积较小的 `alpine` 镜像。","locale":"zh"},"972":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/storage-migration-24","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/storage-migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/storage-migration#4-复制并校验数据","content":"命令应依次输出：","locale":"zh"},"973":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/storage-migration-25","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/storage-migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/storage-migration#4-复制并校验数据","content":"任何一步失败都应停止迁移，不要继续启动新配置。旧数据仍保留在原数据卷中。","locale":"zh"},"974":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/storage-migration-26","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/storage-migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/storage-migration#5-更新-compose-配置","content":"将服务的数据卷挂载改为：","locale":"zh"},"975":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/storage-migration-27","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/storage-migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/storage-migration#5-更新-compose-配置","content":"然后拉取并启动当前镜像：","locale":"zh"},"976":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/storage-migration-28","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/storage-migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/storage-migration#5-更新-compose-配置","content":"如果使用 `docker run`，先删除已停止的旧容器，再用相同端口和环境变量重新创建容器，并使用下面三个挂载：","locale":"zh"},"977":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/storage-migration-29","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/storage-migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/storage-migration#6-验证迁移结果","content":"迁移完成后依次确认：","locale":"zh"},"978":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/storage-migration-30","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/storage-migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/storage-migration#6-验证迁移结果","content":"容器保持运行，日志中没有持续出现启动错误。","locale":"zh"},"979":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/storage-migration-31","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/storage-migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/storage-migration#6-验证迁移结果","content":"WebUI 可以使用原凭据登录，原有设置仍然存在。","locale":"zh"},"980":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/storage-migration-32","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/storage-migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/storage-migration#6-验证迁移结果","content":"QQ 保持原登录状态，不需要重新扫码。","locale":"zh"},"981":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/storage-migration-33","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/storage-migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/storage-migration#6-验证迁移结果","content":"OneBot 的监听端、令牌和机器人连接均与迁移前一致。","locale":"zh"},"982":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/storage-migration-34","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/storage-migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/storage-migration#6-验证迁移结果","content":"实际收发一条测试消息，确认事件接收和消息发送正常。","locale":"zh"},"983":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/storage-migration-35","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/storage-migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/storage-migration#6-验证迁移结果","content":"确认服务稳定前，请保留旧容器配置和旧数据卷。需要回滚时，停止当前容器，恢复升级前的 Compose 文件和镜像版本，再重新启动即可。","locale":"zh"},"984":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/storage-migration-36","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/storage-migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/storage-migration#6-验证迁移结果","content":"旧数据卷不会被本流程自动删除。建议至少完成一次容器重启并再次确认登录状态后，再自行决定是否清理。","locale":"zh"},"985":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/storage-migration-37","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/storage-migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/storage-migration#使用宿主机目录","content":"如果第一步显示挂载类型为 `bind`，数据已经位于宿主机目录，不需要复制 Docker 命名卷。保留原宿主机目录，只将应用数据的容器目标从 `/app/snowluma-data` 改为 `/app/data`；QQ 的两个目标路径保持不变。","locale":"zh"},"986":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/storage-migration-38","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/storage-migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/storage-migration#多账号","content":"额外 QQ 账号的挂载路径仍是 `/app/qq-acct2`、`/app/qq-acct3` 等。如果希望同时更换这些命名卷，请为每个账号创建独立的新卷，重复第四步的复制与校验流程，并确保一个账号只挂载一个独立的完整 `HOME`。","locale":"zh"},"987":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/update","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/update","type":"page","content":"更新","breadcrumbs":["Docs","部署"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/update","locale":"zh"},"988":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/update-0","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/update","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/update","content":"在各部署路径下升级 SnowLuma，且不丢登录态与配置","locale":"zh"},"989":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/update-1","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/update","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/update#docker","content":"Docker","locale":"zh"},"990":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/update-2","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/update","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/update#手动-tarball","content":"手动 tarball","locale":"zh"},"991":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/update-3","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/update","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/update#从源码构建","content":"从源码构建","locale":"zh"},"992":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/update-4","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/update","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/update#版本固定与-qq-版本","content":"版本固定与 QQ 版本","locale":"zh"},"993":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/update-5","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/update","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/update","content":"升级 SnowLuma 的核心原则只有一条：**只替换程序，不动数据**。登录态、账号配置、运行时配置都在数据目录 / 数据卷里，升级时保留它们就不用重新扫码、不用重配。","locale":"zh"},"994":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/update-6","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/update","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/update","content":"WebUI 会提示有新版本可用，可以据此决定何时升级。","locale":"zh"},"995":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/update-7","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/update","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/update#docker","content":"最简单。用 Compose：","locale":"zh"},"996":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/update-8","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/update","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/update#docker","content":"或者手动拉镜像后重建容器：","locale":"zh"},"997":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/update-9","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/update","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/update#docker","content":"**不要删除数据卷**（`qq-gateway-data`、`qq-client-config`、`qq-client-data`）。删了就会丢登录态和配置。`docker rm` 只删容器、不删卷，重建时挂上同名卷即可无缝衔接。","locale":"zh"},"998":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/update-10","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/update","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/update#手动-tarball","content":"从 GitHub Releases 下载新版本对应平台 / 架构的 tarball（full 或 lite，和你原来用的保持一致）。","locale":"zh"},"999":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/update-11","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/update","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/update#手动-tarball","content":"替换程序文件（`index.mjs`、`webui/`、`native/` 等），**保留你的配置 / 数据目录**（`config/` 及其同级数据）。","locale":"zh"},"1000":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/update-12","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/update","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/update#手动-tarball","content":"重新启动：`node ./index.mjs`（Windows 上也可双击 `launcher.bat`）。","locale":"zh"},"1001":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/update-13","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/update","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/update#手动-tarball","content":"建议把数据目录放在解包目录之外，或升级前先备份它，这样直接整目录替换也不会误删配置。","locale":"zh"},"1002":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/update-14","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/update","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/update#从源码构建","content":"`dist/` 会重新生成（`index.mjs`、`launcher.bat`、`webui/`、`native/`）。同样**不要动**你的数据目录，重启即可。","locale":"zh"},"1003":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/update-15","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/update","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/update#版本固定与-qq-版本","content":"内置的 QQ 版本与 native hook &#x2A;*绑定（pinned）**。升级 SnowLuma 本身是安全的，但**不要手动升级容器 / 环境里的那个 QQ**——QQ 的版本一旦变了，版本绑定的 native hook 可能就失效了。","locale":"zh"},"1004":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/update-16","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/update","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/update#版本固定与-qq-版本","content":"Docker 镜像已经通过把 QQ 的静默热更新主机黑洞掉来冻结 QQ 版本（详见 Linux 手动部署）。手动 / 非 Docker 环境也应自行阻止 QQ 自动更新。","locale":"zh"},"1005":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/update-17","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/update","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/update#版本固定与-qq-版本","content":"生产环境建议固定具体的镜像 / 发行版本 tag（例如 `motricseven7/snowluma:v1.10.0`），而不是一直用 `:latest`，这样升级是显式、可控、可回滚的。","locale":"zh"},"1006":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-docker","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-docker","type":"page","content":"Windows · Docker Desktop","breadcrumbs":["Docs","部署"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-docker","locale":"zh"},"1007":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-docker-0","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-docker","content":"在 Windows 上通过 Docker Desktop（WSL2 后端）运行 SnowLuma 的 Linux 镜像","locale":"zh"},"1008":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-docker-1","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-docker","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-docker#安装-docker-desktop","content":"安装 Docker Desktop","locale":"zh"},"1009":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-docker-2","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-docker","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-docker#系统要求","content":"系统要求","locale":"zh"},"1010":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-docker-3","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-docker","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-docker#运行-snowluma-容器","content":"运行 SnowLuma 容器","locale":"zh"},"1011":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-docker-4","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-docker","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-docker#访问","content":"访问","locale":"zh"},"1012":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-docker-5","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-docker","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-docker#该看哪一页","content":"该看哪一页","locale":"zh"},"1013":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-docker-6","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-docker","content":"**先说清楚：SnowLuma 的 Docker 镜像是 Linux 的。** 它在容器里跑的是**无头 Linux QQ** + Xvfb + VNC + noVNC。在 Windows 上你是通过 Docker Desktop 的 **WSL2 后端**来运行这个 Linux 容器——本质上还是在一个轻量 Linux 虚拟机里跑。","locale":"zh"},"1014":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-docker-7","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-docker","content":"如果你想在 Windows 上跑**原生 Windows QQ**（`QQ.exe`），那不该用 Docker，请走 Windows 手动部署。本页讲的是“我就想用容器、不想碰原生 QQ”的场景。","locale":"zh"},"1015":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-docker-8","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-docker","content":"启动后的容器和 Docker（Linux）部署**完全一样**——同一个镜像、同样的 `docker run` / Compose、同样的端口。本页只补上 Windows 这一侧的前置准备。","locale":"zh"},"1016":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-docker-9","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-docker#安装-docker-desktop","content":"到 docs.docker.com 下载 `Docker Desktop Installer.exe`，用**默认的 WSL2 后端**安装。","locale":"zh"},"1017":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-docker-10","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-docker#系统要求","content":"Windows 10 22H2 或 Windows 11 23H2 及以上","locale":"zh"},"1018":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-docker-11","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-docker#系统要求","content":"WSL ≥ 2.1.5","locale":"zh"},"1019":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-docker-12","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-docker#系统要求","content":"8 GB 内存","locale":"zh"},"1020":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-docker-13","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-docker#系统要求","content":"BIOS 里开启虚拟化（VT-x / AMD-V），以及 SLAT","locale":"zh"},"1021":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-docker-14","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-docker#系统要求","content":"安装时如果勾选了 WSL2 后端（默认），Docker Desktop 会自动帮你装 / 启用 WSL2。装完重启，启动 Docker Desktop。","locale":"zh"},"1022":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-docker-15","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-docker#系统要求","content":"确认用的是 WSL2 后端而不是旧的 Hyper-V 后端：Docker Desktop → Settings → General → 勾选 **Use the WSL 2 based engine**。","locale":"zh"},"1023":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-docker-16","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-docker#系统要求","content":"如果你想自己装 / 管理 WSL2（或在 WSL 发行版里直接装原生 Docker Engine，而不走 Docker Desktop），见 WSL2。","locale":"zh"},"1024":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-docker-17","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-docker#运行-snowluma-容器","content":"Docker Desktop 就绪后，直接用规范 Docker 页里的同一条命令。打开 PowerShell：","locale":"zh"},"1025":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-docker-18","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-docker#运行-snowluma-容器","content":"`--cap-add=SYS_PTRACE` 和 `--security-opt seccomp=unconfined` **仍然不能省**。SnowLuma 的 native addon 通过 ptrace 把 hook 注入容器内的 QQ 进程，默认 seccomp profile 会拦截。Docker Desktop 的 WSL2 后端会把这两项透传进 WSL2 内核，所以照常工作。","locale":"zh"},"1026":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-docker-19","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-docker#运行-snowluma-容器","content":"Compose、环境变量、数据卷、多账号等完整参考**不在这里重复**——一切都和 Linux 上一致，请直接看 Docker（Linux）部署。Compose 在 PowerShell 里同样可用：","locale":"zh"},"1027":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-docker-20","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-docker#访问","content":"容器内服务通过 `localhost` 直接访问（Docker Desktop 把端口转发到 Windows 主机）：","locale":"zh"},"1028":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-docker-21","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-docker#访问","content":"地址","locale":"zh"},"1029":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-docker-22","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-docker#访问","content":"用途","locale":"zh"},"1030":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-docker-23","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-docker#访问","content":"`http://localhost:6081/`","locale":"zh"},"1031":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-docker-24","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-docker#访问","content":"noVNC——浏览器里看远程桌面、扫码登录 QQ","locale":"zh"},"1032":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-docker-25","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-docker#访问","content":"`http://localhost:5099/`","locale":"zh"},"1033":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-docker-26","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-docker","tags":[],"type":"text"