aller **does not edit** the other project's files.","locale":"en"},"1673":{"id":"/en/docs/guide/connect-bot-26","page_id":"/en/docs/guide/connect-bot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide/connect-bot#sidecar-install","content":"Then point the bot adapter at `snowluma:3001` (forward) or fill in the reverse URL on the SnowLuma side.","locale":"en"},"1674":{"id":"/en/docs/guide/connect-bot-27","page_id":"/en/docs/guide/connect-bot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide/connect-bot#multiple-accounts","content":"Each UIN has `onebot_<uin>.json`. Defaults all want `3000` / `3001`; a second account needs other ports, or reverse WS to distinct bot endpoints.","locale":"en"},"1675":{"id":"/en/docs/guide/connect-bot-28","page_id":"/en/docs/guide/connect-bot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide/connect-bot#multiple-accounts","content":"Full field list: Configuration.","locale":"en"},"1676":{"id":"/en/docs/guide/developer","page_id":"/en/docs/guide/developer","type":"page","content":"Developer guide","breadcrumbs":["Docs"],"tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/guide/developer","locale":"en"},"1677":{"id":"/en/docs/guide/developer-0","page_id":"/en/docs/guide/developer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide/developer","content":"Monorepo layout, runtime startup chain, and contribution notes","locale":"en"},"1678":{"id":"/en/docs/guide/developer-1","page_id":"/en/docs/guide/developer","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/guide/developer#monorepo-layout","content":"Monorepo layout","locale":"en"},"1679":{"id":"/en/docs/guide/developer-2","page_id":"/en/docs/guide/developer","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/guide/developer#core-startup-chain","content":"Core startup chain","locale":"en"},"1680":{"id":"/en/docs/guide/developer-3","page_id":"/en/docs/guide/developer","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/guide/developer#hook--native-modules","content":"Hook + native modules","locale":"en"},"1681":{"id":"/en/docs/guide/developer-4","page_id"