t","locale":"en"},"1812":{"id":"/en/docs/guide/introduction-56","page_id":"/en/docs/guide/introduction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide/introduction#default-services","content":"noVNC","locale":"en"},"1813":{"id":"/en/docs/guide/introduction-57","page_id":"/en/docs/guide/introduction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide/introduction#default-services","content":"`6081`","locale":"en"},"1814":{"id":"/en/docs/guide/introduction-58","page_id":"/en/docs/guide/introduction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide/introduction#default-services","content":"Docker only: browser remote desktop for QR login","locale":"en"},"1815":{"id":"/en/docs/guide/introduction-59","page_id":"/en/docs/guide/introduction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide/introduction#default-services","content":"Ports and listen addresses are configurable — see the Configuration reference.","locale":"en"},"1816":{"id":"/en/docs/guide/introduction-60","page_id":"/en/docs/guide/introduction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide/introduction#default-services","content":"Do **not** expose noVNC / WebUI / OneBot ports raw on the public internet. Docker has **no** shared default remote-desktop password — the first start generates a random one and prints it once in the container logs.","locale":"en"},"1817":{"id":"/en/docs/guide/introduction-61","page_id":"/en/docs/guide/introduction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide/introduction#project-status","content":"SnowLuma is still in **early development**. Interfaces, config structure, and release layout may change between versions. In production, pin a specific version tag and read the update notes before upgrading.","locale":"en"},"1818":{"id":"/en/docs/guide/introduction-62","page_id":"/en/docs/guide/introduction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide/introduction#next-steps","content":"Quick Start — not sure where to begin? Start here.","locale":"en"},"1819":{"id":"/en/docs/guide/introduction-63"