url":"/en/docs/guide/quickstart#fastest-path-docker","content":"On Linux the recommended path is the official image. Three steps:","locale":"en"},"1855":{"id":"/en/docs/guide/quickstart-34","page_id":"/en/docs/guide/quickstart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide/quickstart#fastest-path-docker","content":"**1. Start the container**","locale":"en"},"1856":{"id":"/en/docs/guide/quickstart-35","page_id":"/en/docs/guide/quickstart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide/quickstart#fastest-path-docker","content":"`--cap-add=SYS_PTRACE` and `--security-opt seccomp=unconfined` are **required**. `--shm-size=1g` is required by QQ. The remote-desktop password is generated on first start and printed once in the logs.","locale":"en"},"1857":{"id":"/en/docs/guide/quickstart-36","page_id":"/en/docs/guide/quickstart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide/quickstart#fastest-path-docker","content":"**2. Scan the login QR**","locale":"en"},"1858":{"id":"/en/docs/guide/quickstart-37","page_id":"/en/docs/guide/quickstart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide/quickstart#fastest-path-docker","content":"Open `http://<server-ip>:6081/` (noVNC). Password:","locale":"en"},"1859":{"id":"/en/docs/guide/quickstart-38","page_id":"/en/docs/guide/quickstart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide/quickstart#fastest-path-docker","content":"QQ is already running on the remote desktop — scan with the QQ mobile app.","locale":"en"},"1860":{"id":"/en/docs/guide/quickstart-39","page_id":"/en/docs/guide/quickstart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide/quickstart#fastest-path-docker","content":"**3. Open the WebUI**","locale":"en"},"1861":{"id":"/en/docs/guide/quickstart-40","page_id":"/en/docs/guide/quickstart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide/quickstart#fastest-path-docker","content":"Open `http://<server-ip>:5099/`. Full Compose and multi-account notes: Docker deployment.","locale":"en"},"1862":{"id":"/en/docs/guide/quickstart-41","page_id":"/en/docs/guide/quickstart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide/quickstart#experimental-one-click-installer-alpha","content":"**Not the default.** This script is in Alpha and will change. If you already have Docker, use the section above. If you want to help test it:","locale":"en"},"1863":{"id":"/en/docs/guide/quickstart-42","page_id":"/en/docs/guide/quickstart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide/quickstart#experimental-one-click-installer-alpha","content":"Interactive mode asks which path; `--yes` without `--mode` defaults to docker. Details: One-click install (experimental).","locale":"en"},"1864":{"id":"/en/docs/guide/quickstart-43","page_id":"/en/docs/guide/quickstart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide/quickstart#login-and-first-access","content":"Whichever path you take, first-time setup always involves these:","locale":"en"},"1865":{"id":"/en/docs/guide/quickstart-44","page_id":"/en/docs/guide/quickstart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide/quickstart#login-and-first-access","content":"**QR login**: SnowLuma is **QR-scan login only** — there's no CLI login. On headless setups you must see the QQ window via VNC / noVNC to scan.","locale":"en"},"1866":{"id":"/en/docs/guide/quickstart-45","page_id":"/en/docs/guide/quickstart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide/quickstart#login-and-first-access","content":"**Find the WebUI temp password**: on the **first** start with a fresh data dir, a one-time admin password is printed to the logs. Docker:","locale":"en"},"1867":{"id":"/en/docs/guide/quickstart-46","page_id":"/en/docs/guide/quickstart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide/quickstart#login-and-first-access","content":"The temp password is printed only on the first start with a fresh data dir. Restarting or reusing an existing data dir will not regenerate it.","locale":"en"},"1868":{"id":"/en/docs/guide/quickstart-47","page_id":"/en/docs/guide/quickstart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide/quickstart#login-and-first-access","content":"**Open ports**: to reach it from outside, allow the WebUI (`5099`) and whichever OneBot ports you use (`3000` / `3001`).","locale":"en"},"1869":{"id":"/en/docs/guide/quickstart-48","page_id":"/en/docs/guide/quickstart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide/quickstart#login-and-first-access","content":"Do **not** expose noVNC / WebUI / OneBot ports raw on the public internet. There is no shared default remote-desktop password — read it from the container logs.","locale":"en"},"1870":{"id":"/en/docs/guide/quickstart-49","page_id":"/en/docs/guide/quickstart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide/quickstart#password-free-login-url-token","content":"Tired of typing the password every visit? The WebUI can sign in directly from a **password** carried in the URL:","locale":"en"},"1871":{"id":"/en/docs/guide/quickstart-50","page_id":"/en/docs/guide/quickstart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide/quickstart#password-free-login-url-token","content":"The query key is `token`, and its **value is your normal WebUI login password**. SnowLuma runs it through the login endpoint; a correct password lands you straight on the home page.","locale":"en"},"1872":{"id":"/en/docs/guide/quickstart-51","page_id":"/en/docs/guide/quickstart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide/quickstart#password-free-login-url-token","content":"**Consumed once**: the password is **stripped from the address bar immediately** after load (`history.replaceState`) so it can't leak via browser history / access logs / the Referer header.","locale":"en"},"1873":{"id":"/en/docs/guide/quickstart-52","page_id":"/en/docs/guide/quickstart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide/quickstart#password-free-login-url-token","content":"The server still verifies it as usual — a wrong password just drops back to the login page, there's no bypass.","locale":"en"},"1874":{"id":"/en/docs/guide/quickstart-53","page_id":"/en/docs/guide/quickstart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide/quickstart#password-free-login-url-token","content":"Putting a password in a URL is **relatively risky** (it enters browser history and may be recorded by intermediate proxies). Only use it on a trusted local / LAN machine; don't share password links, don't paste them into chats / issues, and don't use them on a shared device.","locale":"en"},"1875":{"id":"/en/docs/guide/quickstart-54","page_id":"/en/docs/guide/quickstart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide/quickstart#next","content":"Choose a deployment — detailed comparison of every path.","locale":"en"},"1876":{"id":"/en/docs/guide/quickstart-55","page_id":"/en/docs/guide/quickstart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide/quickstart#next","content":"Configuration reference — ports, access tokens, adapters.","locale":"en"},"1877":{"id":"/en/docs/guide/quickstart-56","page_id":"/en/docs/guide/quickstart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide/quickstart#next","content":"Updating — upgrade without losing your login.","locale":"en"},"1878":{"id":"/en/docs/mcp","page_id":"/en/docs/mcp","type":"page","content":"MCP Usage","breadcrumbs":["Docs","MCP"],"tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/mcp","locale":"en"},"1879":{"id":"/en/docs/mcp-0","page_id":"/en/docs/mcp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/mcp","content":"Connect SnowLuma's OneBot action catalog and optional execution tools to MCP clients","locale":"en"},"1880":{"id":"/en/docs/mcp-1","page_id":"/en/docs/mcp","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/mcp#modes","content":"Modes","locale":"en"},"1881":{"id":"/en/docs/mcp-2","page_id":"/en/docs/mcp","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/mcp#requirements","content":"Requirements","locale":"en"},"1882":{"id":"/en/docs/mcp-3","page_id":"/en/docs/mcp","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/mcp#docs-only-mode","content":"Docs-only mode","locale":"en"},"1883":{"id":"/en/docs/mcp-4","page_id":"/en/docs/mcp","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs